I walk down a charming, old street.
The houses here are very beautiful.
Further ahead, I see a tall church.
I walk past the church.
Then I come to a canal.
I walk over a small bridge.
On the other side of the bridge, there is a park.
I walk through the little park.
It is cold, but the walk is lovely.
I can almost smell the water.
The harbour is probably close now.
